SUMMARY:November meetup - First post-ATO 2026 meetup
DESCRIPTION:All Things Open RTP Meetup\nWe'll host our first post-ATO 2026
  meetup on Tuesday evening\, November 10!\n\nWe'll announce a topic and sp
 eaker soon - be on the lookout! But\, go ahead and save your seat now by R
 SVP'ing.\n\n**Start Time:**\n\n* Doors open at 6:00 pm for networking\, fo
 od and beverages\, and (free) swag\n* Live programming begins at 6:30 pm s
 harp\n\n**Location:**\nWake Technical Community College - RTP Campus\n1090
 8 Chapel Hill Rd.\nMorrisville\, NC 27560\n*\\*We'll be in the auditorium\
 , which is located in building RT1\, room 162. Enter through the side entr
 ance - we'll be there to guide you along.*\n\n**Cost:** FREE\, as always\n
 \n**Questions?** Contact us at [info@allthingsopen.org.](http://info@allth
 ingsopen.org./)\n\n**RSVP required**\n\\*This is a free event. However\, a
 n RSVP is required. Seating is limited\, so RSVP's will be capped as we fi
 ll up. Please move quickly and RSVP to save your spot if interested. When 
 you RSVP you will be added to our mailing list to receive future event upd
 ates. You can unsubscribe at any time.
